<title>NETHERLANDS: NORIT 1996 NET PROFIT 18.5 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>NORIT 1996 NET PROFIT 18.5 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 to Dec 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.53 vs   1.00</p>
<p>    Net profit			    18.50 vs   11.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  0.61 vs   0.42</p>
<p>    Turnover				 367  vs    256</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    26.1  vs   14.6</p>
<p>Note - Norit said part of the 67 percent increase in 1996</p>
<p>net profit could be attributed to acquisitions.</p>
<p>Of the 111.5 million guilders increase in 1996 turnover to</p>
<p>367.3 million guilders, 72 million guilders had to be attributed</p>
<p>to acquisitions.</p>
<p>&quot;As for 1997 we expect -barring unforseen circumstances- a</p>
<p>continuing increase in turnover and profit,&quot; Norit said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>The company said it did not plan to attract any new funds</p>
<p>for the financing of its existing activities in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
